# NEXUS_CHANGELOG.bbcode — paste into the file's changelog box
[size=2][b]v2.0.0 (NEXUS CLEAN) — 2026-10-28 — Public beta[/b][/size]
Two-layer edition for the GOG builds 1.08.1173 and 1.09.1223 (both tested in-game). This archive is the [b]data layer only[/b] — per Nexus rules it contains [b]no scripts and no executables[/b]; install manually (copy to mods\, enable in the MODS menu).
[list]
[*]Data layer (this archive): XML overrides — Fagot-M2 ammo rows, three effect profiles (life_time 0.8 / 0.9 / 1.0, shared 30 m radius), Russian names, DLC rows (We Are Legion / Uprising / Canada). No game PAKs are modified.
[*]Mechanics layer (optional, separate step): the 4-mode engine — an in-place byte patch of your own bin\logic.dll, published as [b]open-source installers on GitHub[/b] (hash-gated: verifies your stock SHA256, backs up, reverts in one command). GOG 1.9: da62ed73… → 65cff273…; 1.08: d320f848… → 97958629….
[*]Engine revision REV1.9.2: vtable range-guard fixes the Schizo/Takeover crash (use-after-free race); campaign on 1.08 completed with zero crashes.
[*]Known beta issues: residual AI on some captured units (robots/spiders); Schizo also repaints own units in the blast (vanilla brainwash logic, kept as a feature); launcher icon falls back to default; rare intermittent hang on game exit after active fire-mode use on GOG 1.9 (under investigation; quitting without firing is clean).
[*]Logging: the engine patch writes diagnostics to bin\FagotM2_debug.log (stays on your PC) — attach it to bug reports.
[/list]
